│    39     `mqtt.Client` did. To bridge that without reconnecting on every publish                                                                           │
│    40     (which would silently turn one long-lived session into one connection                                                                             │
│    41     per message), we start a dedicated background event loop once, enter                                                                              │
│    42     the aiomqtt.Client's async context on that loop, and run every                                                                                    │
│    43     subsequent coroutine on the same loop via                                                                                                         │
