│    20     is no broker acknowledgement to wait on at all. We report rc=0 only to                                                                            │
│    21     mean "the library accepted and queued the message", mirroring paho's                                                                              │
│    22     MQTT_ERR_SUCCESS for that same case -- not "the broker confirmed                                                                                  │
│    23     delivery", which gmqtt's publish() never tells us for QoS 0.                                                                                      │
